== Usage ==
Smooth basalt is a decorative block, and is not currently used for any [[crafting]] or [[smelting]] recipes.

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|section=1|drop=Chaos Cubed}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb smooth basalt, either through picking it up or being interacted with it. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

